{
  "description": "寻圣第二版神经配音：原创成熟男声叙事，角色与旁白分工，不克隆或仿制真人声纹。",
  "version": 2,
  "engine": "Microsoft Edge online neural TTS via edge-tts 7.3.1",
  "output": "prototype/assets/audio/voice-v2",
